{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-07-05 11:00:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY NAMES JOSEPH MCCLELLAND VICE PRESIDENT, EXTERNAL AFFAIRS', 'text': "SIGNIFICANT INDUSTRY EXPERTISE WILL HELP LEAD ALL GOVERNMENT RELATIONS ACTIVITIES FOR THE COMPANY AKRON, OHIO , JULY 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT JOSEPH (JOE) MCCLELLAND HAS BEEN NAMED VICE PRESIDENT, EXTERNAL AFFAIRS, EFFECTIVE JULY 18. MCCLELLAND WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR OVERSEEING ALL GOVERNMENT RELATIONS ACTIVITIES FOR THE COMPANY, INCLUDING LOCAL, STATE AND FEDERAL AFFAIRS, AND ENGAGING WITH POLICYMAKERS ON LEGISLATION THAT MAY IMPACT FIRSTENERGY'S CUSTOMERS AND OPERATIONS."}